    "et": "Kaheksakandi muna",
    "en": "Star egg"
  },
  "summary": {
    "et": "Väike Soma muna kaheksakandidega: kork läheb kinni ainult siis, kui seitse tükki on sees kuubikuks kokku pandud.",
    "en": "A small Soma egg with eight-pointed stars: the cap closes only when the seven pieces inside are packed into a cube."
  },
  "story": {
    "et": "Kaheksakand on Eesti kinnaste ja kirivööde täht. Siin on see muna kestal, ja munas on Soma kuubik nagu suuremas Soma munas.",
    "en": "The kaheksakand is the eight-pointed star of Estonian mittens and woven belts. Here it is on the shell, and inside is a Soma cube, as in the larger Soma egg."
  },
